        "TileImage": "$($repository 5b76b821-b4d5-42e7-a3ce-52bb5775614a).Image",
        "Description": "Your two dancing showercap sink cats have vanished beneath Manhattan. Intercepts confirm Marty Allmon, Matt Platt, and Tanner Godley sealed the sewer access tunnels and rigged the basement floodgates. If they aren’t eliminated tonight, the tunnels will overflow by dawn. Targets are spread across New York under heavy security. Neutralize all three by any method, recover the cats, and extract before city lockdown begins. (also the cats will die if you fail, and they&apos;re very cute)",
